---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Let AI Write Its Own Instructions — Luxon Learn" description="Don't know what to tell your AI? Ask it to figure it out for you.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/legacy-shared.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/learn/learn-styles.css" />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Lesson Hero -->
  <section class="lesson-hero">
    <div class="lesson-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/learn">Learn</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>Lesson 6</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson-badge">Level 2</div>
    <h1>Let AI Write Its Own Instructions</h1>
    <p class="lesson-subtitle">Don't know what to tell your AI? Ask it to figure it out for you.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="lesson-content">

    <!-- Visual: You → AI → Better Instructions -->
    <div class="lesson-visual">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 640 280" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- Step 1: You thinking -->
        <rect x="20" y="40" width="170" height="200" rx="16" fill="#f0f9ff" stroke="#bae6fd"/>
        <text x="105" y="75" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#0369a1" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">🤔 YOU</text>
        <text x="105" y="100" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">"I need help with</text>
        <text x="105" y="116" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">weekly reports but</text>
        <text x="105" y="132" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">I don't know what</text>
        <text x="105" y="148" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#dc2626" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">to tell the AI..."</text>

        <!-- Arrow 1 -->
        <path d="M200 140 L220 140" stroke="#4285f4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow6)"/>
        <defs><marker id="arrow6" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto"><polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#4285f4"/></marker></defs>

        <!-- Step 2: AI thinking -->
        <rect x="230" y="40" width="170" height="200" rx="16" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#e9d5ff"/>
        <text x="315" y="75" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">🤖 AI</text>
        <text x="315" y="100" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">"Help me write the</text>
        <text x="315" y="116" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">best custom</text>
        <text x="315" y="132" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">instructions for this</text>
        <text x="315" y="148" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">task."</text>
        <text x="315" y="175" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#7c3aed" text-anchor="middle">✨ Generates</text>
        <text x="315" y="191" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#7c3aed" text-anchor="middle">custom rules</text>

        <!-- Arrow 2 -->
        <path d="M410 140 L430 140" stroke="#4285f4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow6)"/>

        <!-- Step 3: Better results -->
        <rect x="440" y="40" width="180" height="200" rx="16" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#bbf7d0"/>
        <text x="530" y="75" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">✓ RESULTS</text>
        <rect x="460" y="90" width="140" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="470" y="108" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#16a34a">📄 Use table format</text>
        <rect x="460" y="124" width="140" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="470" y="142" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#16a34a">📄 Highlight variances</text>
        <rect x="460" y="158" width="140" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="470" y="176" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#16a34a">📄 Keep under 1 page</text>
        <text x="530" y="218" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Perfect output ✓</text>
      </svg>
      <p class="lesson-visual-caption">The AI knows what it needs better than you do. Let it write its own instructions — then refine them together.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Steps -->
    <div class="lesson-steps">
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">1</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>The meta-prompt</h3>
          <p>Instead of struggling to write perfect instructions, tell the AI what you're trying to accomplish and ask it to create its own guidelines. Example: "I write weekly sales reports. Help me write the best custom instructions so you can help me faster."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">2</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>Refine together</h3>
          <p>The AI will generate a set of instructions. Read them — they'll be surprisingly good. Then tweak: remove what doesn't fit, add details it missed, and adjust the tone. Two heads are better than one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">3</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>Save and reuse</h3>
          <p>Once you're happy with the instructions, save them to your project (Lesson 2) or custom instructions. Every future conversation starts with this context — no more repeating yourself.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Compare -->
    <div class="lesson-compare">
      <div class="lesson-compare__box lesson-compare__box--bad">
        <div class="lesson-compare__label">Before</div>
        <p class="lesson-compare__text">"Make a report. Make it good. I don't know, just make it look professional."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-compare__box lesson-compare__box--good">
        <div class="lesson-compare__label">After</div>
        <p class="lesson-compare__text">"Help me write instructions so you can generate my weekly sales report perfectly every time."</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tip -->
    <div class="lesson-tip">
      <div class="lesson-tip__icon">💡</div>
      <div class="lesson-tip__text"><strong>Pro tip:</strong> This works for any recurring task — emails, social media posts, meeting notes. The AI has processed millions of examples. Let it tell you what it needs.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="lesson-cta">
      <h3>Want this set up for you?</h3>
      <p>We configure everything — personalization, projects, and workflows — in one session.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/85297381028" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book installation</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Lesson Nav -->
  <div class="lesson-nav">
    <a href="/learn/lesson-5" class="prev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M19 12H5m7-7-7 7 7 7"/></svg> Say What TO Do</a>
    <a href="/learn/lesson-7" class="next">Smarter ≠ Better <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
